<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt warrants on Lander deal.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt warrants on Lander deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt said it had issued 40 million call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the 6.25 pct Landerschatzanweisung No 1 1996/2006.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	03.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER DDF FFT HAM STG   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  97.57 PCT</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  STRIKE		ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	     98.00 PCT	  0.95 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	    100.00 PCT	  0.49 DEM</p>
<p> PUT C		96.00 PCT	  2.95 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D		94.00 PCT	  1.85 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
